#: ../../tools/lncrna_tools.rst:32 5aaa6485b723435d84288f4121115169
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed lncRNA information from RNAcentral "
"including full RNA sequence, species, gene associations, publication "
"count, and source databases. Use a species-specific RNAcentral ID "
"(format: URS\\_TAXID) or base URS ID with optional taxid. Key lncRNA IDs:"
" URS0002A146E4\\_9606 (MALAT1, 7472 nt), URS00026A23F2\\_9606 (HOTAIR, "
"2273 nt), URS000075DAEC\\_9606 (NEAT1, 3756 nt). Returns the full "
"nucleotide sequence which can be used for downstream analysis (structure "
"prediction, conservation, etc.)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/lncrna_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/lncrna_tools.rst:68
#: ../../tools/lncrna_tools.rst:102 ../../tools/lncrna_tools.rst:136
